1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,180
How to design motion graphics using cloud?

2
00:00:02,420 --> 00:00:05,080
First go to prompt motion and find an animation you like.

3
00:00:05,340 --> 00:00:09,760
Every video comes with a prompt behind it, so just copy the one you like, then open cloud

4
00:00:09,760 --> 00:00:10,620
and paste it in.

5
00:00:10,740 --> 00:00:14,340
Describe your own idea underneath and upload your website or brand guidelines.

6
00:00:14,700 --> 00:00:17,960
Select opus 5.5, set the effort to max and hit send.

7
00:00:18,160 --> 00:00:18,960
And the video is ready!

8
00:00:19,240 --> 00:00:22,020
Use it for your lunch, your socials or even your pitch deck.

9
00:00:22,280 --> 00:00:25,100
Comment motion and I'll send you a complete guide with use cases.
